  "mechanism": {
    "original": "acq_rel atomic lowers to atom.global.gpu.acq_rel.add[.v2].f32 with two bar.sync sites in retained representative PTX.",
    "relaxed": "Same source except sem=relaxed lowers to red.global.gpu.relaxed.add[.v2].f32, with no bar.sync sites in those representatives.",
    "native": "RMW/zero variants remove atomics and also have no bar.sync sites.",
    "qualification": "The control changes ordering and all consequent compiler lowering together; it does not isolate barrier cost from atom versus red cost. Instruction-site counts are static.",
